  • Run trusted Stage 4 preflight and independently audit obligations and fixed target
  • If in proof mode, clean-build a fresh Base copy and audit target, trust, axioms, and operational bridges
  • Write self-contained REVIEW.md with evidence and exactly one final verdict pair
